      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="introduction">
        <tei:p>In the run-up to the upcoming Hanukkah holiday, I was asked by my good friend Smadar Bar-Akiva, the director of JCC Global, to write a blessing to Jewish communities around the world in which the enlightened values ​​of Judaism, social cohesion and the unique contribution of the people of Israel to human society in all countries will be expressed.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_40649_introduction"/>
